{"agent_id":"pp3g-ODIv-fix-pass-on-observer-v1-under-460-close-the-six-8ff6","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-25T04:17:23.374674295Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"1119c189-2781-4d21-bbc7-53157a03d0c2","comment_uuid":"65c75ae2-2849-4538-b0b8-3cb8b4ea3057","author":"pp3g-ODIv-fix-pass-on-observer-v1-under-460-close-the-six-8ff6","content":"Plan: FIX PASS on Observer v1 - close the six convergent blockers, one commit each, suite green after every commit (baseline verified live: 98/98 in-repo, 96/98 from /tmp reproducing the T16 CWD dependence). [FIX1 CWD hermeticity] normalize all path env vars to absolute BEFORE any cd; discover OB_CROSSLINK_ROOT by walking up from SCRIPT_DIR for .crosslink (env-overridable OBSERVER_CROSSLINK_ROOT, fallback OB_REPO_ROOT); cd $OB_CROSSLINK_ROOT in the bash wrapper; python run() gains cwd param and EVERY crosslink call site (post_comment, kickoff_cleanup, kickoff_stop, last_hub_position, finished-unmarkable issue show, admission issue-exists/claimed) passes cwd=CROSSLINK_ROOT explicitly; git calls already use -C absolute paths; harness run_cycle cds to a neutral dir so T16 proves independence. [FIX2 strict failure mode] set -euo pipefail with documented exceptions: bash loop rewritten to 'out=$(cmd) || rc=$?' pattern for liveness/cat/compact/cycle-program invocations, pipefail makes python failures propagate through pipes; state-dir mkdir failure = loud fatal exit; events appends get stderr-fallback helper instead of silent 2>/dev/null; cycle-program failure now increments consecutive-error counter (halt-not-loop); save_state failure escalates (event + stderr + nonzero main() rc so the error cap can halt); unused timeout_ok param removed; backup critical failures (hot-copy fail, RED verify, sync fail) escalate via deduped flag-issue alert comment + shortened retry backoff (OBSERVER_BACKUP_RETRY_MINS default 15) instead of silently waiting a full interval. [FIX3 deliverable-gated cleanup] act_completed reordered: deliverable_check FIRST, kickoff_cleanup ONLY when deliverable_present true; fail/indeterminate -> NO cleanup + worktree preserved + force-sweep flag + deduped flag comment + staging row cleanup=skipped-unverified-deliverable; T1/T12 refit with real git worktree fixtures (deliverable present), new T18 covers no-branch and empty-branch (#460 false-positive class) skip paths. [FIX4 parked-expiry re-verification] parked-expiry branch re-scans attributed log tail via loginfo(); fresh rate-limit signature -> extend park with resume_at = max(parsed, now+PARKED_DEFAULT_MINS grace), source=park-extension-fresh-signature, event parked-extended; kill only on expiry AND clean tail; T5 extended with extension-phase + floor assertions before the clean-tail expiry kill. [FIX5 instance lockfile] noclobber O_EXCL-style lockfile observer.lock with PID; second instance refuses loudly (stderr + fatal event + exit 1); stale-PID-alive detection via kill -0 with one recover-retry; owned-flag-guarded trap removes lock only if we own it; new T19 covers held-refusal + stale-recovery + cleanup. [FIX6 watermark hold on sync failure] wave_backup restructured: local GREEN read-back produces CANDIDATE watermarks only; commitment deferred to sync gate - remote sync GREEN commits them and clears sync_backlog; sync RED holds ALL watermarks + queues artifacts into bk[sync_backlog] retried next pass + explicit SYNC-FAILED line in sync-pending.log; remote-unconfigured local mode advances watermarks with explicit acknowledgment event (existing PENDING line kept); rclone positive-path export-artifact read-back stays WHAT-NOT-TESTED per dispatch constraint (index-only remote read-back unchanged). Constraints honored: incremental commits ~5min referencing #460, no new top-level files, no rclone positive-path/fault-injection work.","created_at":"2026-08-25T04:17:23.364749937Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:6e4CKr9qWKIo/QDlRxXHjnpD6gvfXbVhWSiQrVCBI/w","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgt